  "narrative": {
    "intro": "This ranking lists the largest federal contracts by total value for FY2026 to date. HUMANA GOVERNMENT BUSINESS INC is the top entry at $51.3B. LOCKHEED MARTIN CORP follows at $48.1B. NATIONAL TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS OF SANDIA, LLC appears at $42.8B, and UT-BATTELLE LLC appears at $42.3B. LAWRENCE LIVERMORE NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC is listed at $41.3B. REGENTS OF THE UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA, THE is listed at $35.3B. TRIAD NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC is listed at $35.1B. LOCKHEED MARTIN CORPORATION is listed at $35.1B. ELECTRIC BOAT CORPORATION is listed at $34.9B. CONSOLIDATED NUCLEAR SECURITY, LLC is listed at $34.4B. The page notes that total award value figures are full contract values, not single-year obligations. The period covered is FY2026 to date. The page title is Largest federal contracts by total value, FY2026 to date. The ranking presents ten firms and their reported total contract values for the period.",
